body:
See attached for the {{company}} contract at {{venue}} at {{preferred_date}}. Please review, sign, and return when you have a moment.

Once signed, to reserve your date, here are the deposit links: {{Deposit_Number}}

Please let me know when processed and will confirm this is our system."

Program Planning Discussion – {{name}}/ Mangia DC
Dave from 202.769.4929 will contact {{name}} from {{phone}}
If you could be by a computer for our discussion, I’d greatly appreciate it.

Program Planning Discussion – {{company}}/ Mangia DC
Dave from 202.769.4929 will contact {{name}} from {{phone}}
If you could be by a computer for our discussion, I’d greatly appreciate it.

Good morning {{name}},

{{meeting_date}} works perfectly and sent you a calendar invite to reserve our time. If you could be by a computer for our discussion I’d greatly appreciate it.

Also to better understand your group dynamic please fill out this questionnaire and return before our discussion. I went ahead and filled out what you already told me:

Name: {{name}}

What is the occasion?

What date(s) did you have in mind? Please send us multiple available dates when you have a moment? {{preferred_date}}

What time of day is preferred for this event or is that flexible? {{preferred_time}}

Would you like this to be in person, virtual, or hybrid (in-person & virtual)?

What is your day time phone number? {{phone}}

Around how many people do you have in mind?  {{headcount}}

Do you need transportation?

Would you consider the group to be none, light, or moderate drinkers?

Would you consider your group(s) competitive or not so much?

What is your budget for this event?

Would you be responsible for processing this or who else would need to be involved?
